WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
MuJoCo kinematic concept. Labeled Diamond, Gyroid, and Primitive pairs show the supplied slot and tenon variants.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The three tenon variants approach their stationary partners in a staggered, scripted sequence.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The pairs hold nominal neighboring positions for a geometry comparison. Fit and force-based assembly are not validated.
